      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管是饮食、搞笑、衣服还是会嗨起来的点，\n能合得来比较好吧，轻松合拍不是很棒吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51a88c9b684779931f6098f17bbcf0c70fd122273c812cac3c1a1cbc38e2472",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
