    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31a8b190958f2e62381e8f67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦喃喃说道。我们之间虽然还是有点距离，\n但只要我们持续沟通，相信这个距离也能渐渐拉近──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e081408e947b27ae8f1fa7c80bb1951d66cfee99986b6f4632666b8c264c760",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1048/storytimeline_041048007.json",
      "json_path": [
