    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72530afad1a6251ecfaf49f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我超～期待的～打死我都要去！\n我现在可是非常努力，可别说要延长训练时间喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d512a4eccab31068fd09e05841582c3165037a19338fb419dc934ec93355104a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1048/storytimeline_041048007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
