      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是喔……都来参加集训了，你还真拼呢。\n算了。总之我先准备下个训练～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a2761cd214d2f694151e8646751b680dc8f132135e6219790167a2f32a10ba9",
